      <!-- Focus hold (include/nbt/hmi_hold.h): nothing in 14 or 15 is selectable, so knob input reaches neither
           iDrive's menus nor an action while the manager window covers the screen. BACK pops 14 to its parent 15;
           the plugin then returns iDrive to 14. States are numbered by XML order: append new ones after these. -->
